  "description": "Wedding SVG Four fold card Laser cut template. Suitable for cutting on Cricut, Silhouette Cameo, Laser cut, and other cutting machines. Folded size 5.7×5.7 inches. This card with an openwork cutout pattern will decorate your wedding invitations, birthday greetings, and happy anniversary cards.\nMaterials: Cardstock 12×12 and more.\nThickness: 70-90 lb, 160-240 gsm.\nThe difficulty of execution: easy.\nYou will receive the following file formats:\n– 2 SVG Cutting files for Cricut DS\n– 1 CDR\n– 1 PLT\n– 1 DWG\n– 1 DXF\n– 1 Studio3 file for Silhouette Cameo\n– 1 PDF\n– 1 EPS 10\n– 1 AI\n– 1 PNG 300 dpi\nand 1 PNG 300 dpi with parttern for text as in the preview.\nLook at the preview for info about how to place the template on paper, the size of the paper, and for the exact dimensions of each part of the template.\nYou can choose any color for the finished product.\nYou can enlarge templates without quality loss.",
